&lt;p&gt;I live in Saragossa, Spain. You can follow me on &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/gimenete&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://bsky.app/profile/gimenete.net&quot;&gt;BlueSky&lt;/a&gt;. DMs are open.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;A bit about me:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2024&lt;/code&gt;: Joined Stripe. Started &lt;a href=&quot;https://githero.app/&quot;&gt;GitHero.app&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt; 
