 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2019&lt;/code&gt;: Joined &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/features/actions&quot;&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2018&lt;/code&gt;: Joined GitHub.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2017&lt;/code&gt;: First child. Bought a house.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2015&lt;/code&gt;: Lived in Barcelona.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2014&lt;/code&gt;: Lived in Vermont. Started working for &lt;a href=&quot;https://clevertech.biz/&quot;&gt;Clevertech&lt;/a&gt;, based in NYC.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2013&lt;/code&gt;: Started working for &lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2014/08/28/downtown-launches-mobile-payment-app-in-palo-alto/&quot;&gt;Downtown&lt;/a&gt;, based in Palo Alto.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;2011&lt;/code&gt;: Started a company: Backbeam. A MBaaS.&lt;/li&gt; 
